{
  "name": "loss_diffadvantage_tanh_relu_costgap_weighted_sum_repaired_v2",
  "intuition": "Preserve tanh transformed advantage difference and relu cost gap difference; ensure outputs require grad via explicit operations on batch tensors with requires_grad",
  "pseudocode": "adv_diff = tanh(advantage_w) - tanh(advantage_l)\ncost_effect = relu(cost_gap)\nloss_raw = cost_effect - adv_diff\nloss = mean(weight * loss_raw) with ensured grad",
